Create a dedicated Knowledge Library interface.
It should allow the user to:
•	Upload documents
•	Drag and drop files
•	Create categories
•	Create projects
•	Search knowledge
•	View documents
•	Preview documents
•	Delete documents
•	Rename documents
•	View processing status
•	View file metadata
•	Enable/disable documents
•	Ask JARVIS about a document
•	See which project/category owns a document
Example interface:
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              JARVIS KNOWLEDGE                │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────┤
